// | `profile` | none - one profile activation per owner and target |
// | `rule` | `TrafficMatch` (changing the action replaces the rule) |
// | `dns` | the set of `names` |
// | `tls` | `TrafficMatch` + `sni` |
// | `dhcp` | `action` |
// | `wireguard` | `client` or `link` + `action` |
